 "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 2, "score_up": 147, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToYxZpKt", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 699, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8923903, "raw_content": "", "author": "I-am-Orlando", "created": 1793851324738, "profile_picture": "TEnkk5XkT6JN", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Daughterfreedom76", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1AToYxZpKt.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/7JLIN8rost8Y.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/HKZQc6bQHSfgEnwi.jpeg", "width": 482, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 768}], "blurhash": "U6DvHCD$0X%gxvog-pWB00W;{a={T0WA$+kC", "full_resolution": [1720, 1080]}, "title": "I'm sure that was legit \ud83e\udd14 ", "last_comment_created": 1793902751824, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 2, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 60, "score_up": 699, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToYyhOuW", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 99, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "hat", "id": 8924638, "raw_content": "~1 in 3.5 \u00d7 10\u00b9\u2070 (about 1 in 35 billion) vs. Powerball jackpot odds of 1 in 292,201,338 (about 1 in 292 million).\u2060\n\nFrom the Grok post you linked: under the pre-2010 residual SD (~15 pts), the odds that all 254 Texas counties shift the same direction on a +20 mean shift are ~1 in 3.5\u00d710\u00b9\u2070 (far under 0.00000001%).\u2060X\n\nComparison\n\nGrok\u2019s figure: \u2248 1 in 35,000,000,000\nPowerball jackpot: 1 in 292,201,338\n\nThat county-shift probability is roughly 120\u00d7 RARER than winning the Powerball jackpot on a single ticket (35e9 \u00f7 292e6 \u2248 120).\u2060Bitsandodds\n\nIn other words, the Powerball jackpot is about 120 times more likely than that extreme \u201call 254 counties move together\u201d scenario under the older, higher-variance residual SD. (Recent 3\u20134 pt SD makes the same county shift near-certain, per the same post.)\n\nPowerball overall prize odds are far better (about 1 in 24.87), but the pure jackpot comparison is the relevant one here.", "author": "DCSucks", "created": 1793889511804, "profile_picture": "HROqPiS20z4h", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Tardigrade", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "GROK says \"odds all 254 TX counties shift the same direction on a +20 mean: ~1 in 3.5\u00d710\u00b9\u2070 (far under 0.00000001%)\" So I asked GROK to compare the odds to winning the Powerball:", "last_comment_created": 1793898831850, "content": "<p>~1 in 3.5 \u00d7 10\u00b9\u2070 (about 1 in 35 billion) vs. Powerball jackpot odds of 1 in 292,201,338 (about 1 in 292 million).\u2060</p>\n<p>From the Grok post you linked: under the pre-2010 residual SD (~15 pts), the odds that all 254 Texas counties shift the same direction on a +20 mean shift are ~1 in 3.5\u00d710\u00b9\u2070 (far under 0.00000001%).\u2060X</p>\n<p>Comparison</p>\n<p>Grok\u2019s figure: \u2248 1 in 35,000,000,000\nPowerball jackpot: 1 in 292,201,338</p>\n<p>That county-shift probability is roughly 120\u00d7 RARER than winning the Powerball jackpot on a single ticket (35e9 \u00f7 292e6 \u2248 120).\u2060Bitsandodds</p>\n<p>In other words, the Powerball jackpot is about 120 times more likely than that extreme \u201call 254 counties move together\u201d scenario under the older, higher-variance residual SD. (Recent 3\u20134 pt SD makes the same county shift near-certain, per the same post.)</p>\n<p>Powerball overall prize odds are far better (about 1 in 24.87), but the pure jackpot comparison is the relevant one here.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 10, "score_up": 99, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "SAVE AMERICA", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToYyhg1Y", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 85, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8924740, "raw_content": "His policies are good and working but the senate had no follow through to pass anything and the war probably had an impact but not like 2 million extra fraudulent Democrat voters in Texas did. ", "author": "Will-Not-Comply", "created": 1793892502457, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Will-Not-Comply", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "I've heard people say this election was \"a humiliation for Trump and the repudiation of his policies\" and that \"MAGA is officially dead now\" and then you realize that they stole the election and are doing whatever they can to destroy Trump's legacy because they never want another Trump. ", "last_comment_created": 1793901039686, "content": "<p>His policies are good and working but the senate had no follow through to pass anything and the war probably had an impact but not like 2 million extra fraudulent Democrat voters in Texas did.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 12, "score_up": 85, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}], "status": true}